  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Fisheries Sector of Mozambique 2013 - 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme aims at having fisheries authorities strengthened in their abilities to promote the development and management of small-scale fisheries and aquaculture and activities that have high potential to improve food security and nutrition in fish to the local population, and to ensure sustainable and viable use of aquatic resources.</narrative>
  </description>
